# How varied the meadow is, by measure (reports/engine/2026-11-14-meadow-ground, «Что отняло жизнь»), in still air:
# five views of landscape-meadow.bench, each with the meadow's ground painted (`grass parts 193`, mask-<view>), its
# squares of 0.5 m and of 5 m painted (`grass parts 8385`, cells-<view>) and the frame itself (<view>-0).
#   scripts/grass_look.py mask mask-<view>.png m.png; scripts/grass_look.py variety m.png cells-<view>.png <frames>
# On game-verge-along, walk-mid (a place of the walk of meadow-walk, the game's camera) and far the look of a ground
# with its own layers is also taken back to a painted ground's, a part at a time (Grass::Part): <view>-512 the
# blades' tips and root shade, -1024 the colour a blade starts from, -1536 both, -2048 the ground's shade and far
# tint, -4096 the painted ground in place of the layers, -6144 both, -7680 all four. OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_FINE=0 gives
# the short sward its broad blades back.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh landscape-meadow-variety
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
set time 12 0
cloth wind calm

goto NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_03
clear 3000
face wp NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_05
streaming wait
grass wait
wait 5000
grass parts 193
wait 1200
shot mask-meadow-1
wait 200
grass parts 8385
wait 1200
shot cells-meadow-1
wait 200
grass parts 0
wait 1200
shot meadow-1-0
wait 200
grass parts 0
turn 180
wait 2500
grass parts 193
wait 1200
shot mask-meadow-3
wait 200
grass parts 8385
wait 1200
shot cells-meadow-3
wait 200
grass parts 0
wait 1200
shot meadow-3-0
wait 200
grass parts 0
grass stats

